flowchart TD
  CLI[scaffold.js: parseArgs, loadData, main] --> Core
  MCP[mcp-server.js: createServer, requireDep, resolveInRoot] --> Core

  subgraph Core["agents/boilerplats/lib/core.js"]
    validateData --> render
    render --> scaffoldCreate[scaffoldCreate: --out is new file]
    render --> scaffoldInject[scaffoldInject: insert above marker]
    scaffoldInject --> scaffoldAdopt[scaffoldAdopt: unmarked legacy file, place marker via anchor]
    scaffoldAdopt --> Anchor
    scaffoldInject --> numberedLines
    scaffoldInject --> scanFillable[scanFillable: fillable line numbers for the caller]
  end

  subgraph Anchor["lib/anchor.js"]
    braceAnchor[braceAnchor: C-like langs]
    pythonAnchor[pythonAnchor]
    shAnchor[shAnchor]
    resolveAnchor --> findAnchor
  end

  Core --> Meta[lib/template-meta.js: markerFor, listLanguages, listTemplates]
  Meta --> Templates

  subgraph Templates["boilerplats/<lang>/*.hbs"]
    csharp[csharp/]
    go[go/]
    javascript[javascript/]
    typescript[typescript/]
    python[python/]
    sh["sh/ (function, helper, member, script, validator only)"]
  end

  Templates -.-> Kinds["controller, repository, handler, validator, factory,\nmapper, query, command, request, response, helper,\ndi-injection, member"]

  Guard[claude/hooks/boilerplate-guard.sh: PreToolUse Edit/Write] -->|blocks hand-written boilerplate by filename + content signature| CLI
  Hint[claude/hooks/boilerplate-hint.sh: UserPromptSubmit] -.suggests scaffold_* tools.-> CLI
